se,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","color":"447744","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471795,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE3OTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:thirdparty","name":"topic:thirdparty","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-05-25T19:06:03Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T17:09:40Z","closed_at":"2026-09-27T16:30:19Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119750","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119750","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119750.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119750.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-27T16:30:19Z"},"body":"> [!NOTE]\r\n> AI-assisted contribution disclosure:\r\nClaude Code was used to help generate an initial boilerplate draft based on the existing macOS AccessKit implementation and to explore unfamiliar APIs. The generated code was not accepted as-is and required significant manual debugging, modification, integration work, and testing.\r\nThe implementation was built, exported, and tested manually on physical iOS hardware with VoiceOver enabled. Additional fixes and follow-up changes were made during review and integration.\r\nThis PR should be considered AI-assisted, not AI-authored.\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\niOS is currently the only major Godot platform without screen reader support. macOS, Windows, and Linux already integrate the AccessKit-based `AccessibilityServerAccessKit` driver, but iOS has no implementation, so VoiceOver cannot read `Control` elements.\r\n\r\nThis PR adds the missing iOS glue so VoiceOver works out of the box, using the same driver and the upstream `accesskit_ios_subclassing_adapter`.\r\n\r\n- Closes #\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n### This PR depends on\r\n\r\n* **AccessKit C 0.22.1** (released 2026-05-24, [AccessKit/accesskit-c#94](https://github.com/AccessKit/accesskit-c/pull/94)), which introduces the iOS adapters.\r\n\r\n* A matching **godot-accesskit-c-static** release with iOS binaries / XCFramework https://github.com/godotengine/godot-accesskit-c-static/pull/8.\r\n\r\n### Test plan\r\n\r\nManual VoiceOver testing - no automated tests added. \r\n\r\n|XCFramework|VoiceOver|\r\n|-|-|\r\n|<img width=\"295\" height=\"431\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-05-25 at 2 11 37 AM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b659324b-ce8c-4caf-81ed-4deac44e7c0b\" />|<video src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/13bd7c45-b879-4b0b-a66f-c53c71cbc068\">|\r\n\r\n### Reviewers wanting to reproduce: \r\n\r\n1. Checkout [godotengine/godot-accesskit-c-static#8](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-accesskit-c-static/pull/8) and build the AccessKit iOS SDK (or grab artifacts from its CI). Point `$AK_SDK` at the result.\r\n2. Build Godot iOS templates:\r\n```bash\r\nscons platform=ios target=template_debug arch=arm64 simulator=yes accesskit=yes accesskit_sdk_path=$AK_SDK\r\nscons platform=ios target=template_debug arch=arm64 accesskit=yes accesskit_sdk_path=$AK_SDK generate_bundle=yes\r\n```\r\n3. Build the macOS editor, install bin/godot_ios.zip as your iOS export template, export an iOS project.\r\n4. Open the resulting Xcode project, build to an iPhone with VoiceOver enabled.\r\n\r\nOR \r\n\r\nCheckout my game that currently has the 4.7 custom Godot build with AccessKit!! Note: The accessibility experience will be improved in future updates, so don't judge too harshly.\r\n* https://testflight.apple.com/join/wBCbQaGS\r\n<img width=\"100\" height=\"100\" alt=\"extended\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/50a4a77c-03a1-46aa-98e6-e0ab2d9f232e\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nTip: You can enable Settings > Accessibility > Accessibility Shortcut > VoiceOver to quickly switch between VoiceOver on/off with a triple-click on the power button!","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119750/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119750/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}